I mean, I think the
great one you use is

00:40:53.684 --> 00:40:55.820 align:start size:88% position:13%
that the people who
say they're anti-racist

00:40:55.820 --> 00:40:59.023
are the ones who are
acting in a racist way.

00:40:59.023 --> 00:41:01.492
And the way George
Orwell describes it

00:41:01.492 --> 00:41:03.627 align:start size:97% position:3%
is he calls it double think.
- Mm-hmm.

00:41:03.627 --> 00:41:06.630
- So double think is this idea

00:41:06.630 --> 00:41:10.935
that you hold two
contradictory ideas

00:41:10.935 --> 00:41:13.137
at exactly the same time.

00:41:13.137 --> 00:41:15.739 align:start position:0%
So you can never admit that
the ideas don't make any sense.

00:41:15.739 --> 00:41:18.642
So for instance,
we have to get rid

00:41:18.642 --> 00:41:20.311
of America's terrible past,

00:41:20.311 --> 00:41:23.013
which had segregation and
the way we're gonna do that

00:41:23.013 --> 00:41:25.115
is institute segregation.
- Through segregation.

00:41:25.115 --> 00:41:26.584
Look, think about it this way.

00:41:26.584 --> 00:41:28.319 align:start size:97% position:3%
What's like the hottest
book on the left right now?

00:41:28.319 --> 00:41:29.587 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's "White Fragility."
- Yes.

00:41:29.587 --> 00:41:31.522
- What's the subtitle
of "White Fragility"?

00:41:31.522 --> 00:41:32.690
I don't know what it is exactly,

00:41:32.690 --> 00:41:34.124 align:start size:84% position:16%
but in essence
it's something like

00:41:34.124 --> 00:41:35.526 align:start size:84% position:16%
how white people can,
blah, blah, blah.

00:41:35.526 --> 00:41:37.261 align:start size:72% position:28%
That's racist.
- Yeah.

00:41:37.261 --> 00:41:39.396
- That in and of
itself is racist.

00:41:39.396 --> 00:41:41.031
Forget "White Fragility."

00:41:41.031 --> 00:41:42.500
Well, but then if you
say how white people,

00:41:42.500 --> 00:41:44.902
the implication is all
white people are this,

00:41:44.902 --> 00:41:46.003
whatever this is.

00:41:46.003 --> 00:41:46.971
That is racist.

00:41:46.971 --> 00:41:49.273
So they hold these two ideas

00:41:49.273 --> 00:41:51.876
that are completely at
odds with each other

00:41:51.876 --> 00:41:54.979
and they hold it because
that allows you to believe

00:41:54.979 --> 00:41:57.982
anything basically
